# ── Not published ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both live on disk and are deliberately NOT in this repo.
#   - The client design system is 170MB of reference material the built site
#     never loads at runtime; hugo-site/vendor/ holds the tokens it actually
#     uses.
#   - LESSONS-LEARNED.md is cross-project working notes, not part of the
#     deliverable.
Hugo coffee design system/
LESSONS-LEARNED.md

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo-wide, so a .env anywhere in the tree is ignored — not just the one in
# hugo-site/. A live kie.ai key lives in hugo-site/.env; it must never be
# committed. .env.example is the checked-in template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json

# ── Generated hero assets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw model output and intermediates. The committed deliverables are the
# encoded hero.mp4 / hero.webm and the poster still — not the raw downloads.
media/*_raw.png
media/raw*.mp4
media/attempts/
media/frames/

# ── Node ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ── macOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# ── Editors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Build / serve ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
.cache/
*.log

# Kie task ids (recovery log)
.kie-tasks.log
